    // The function smelts three raw iron into iron ingots, first ensuring at least three raw iron are available by mining iron ore with a suitable pickaxe if needed. It then finds a reliable fuel source, searching for coal ore or chopping a log to craft planks if no fuel is in the inventory. Next, it ensures a furnace is nearby, placing one from inventory if necessary. Before smelting, it re-verifies the fuel is still in the inventory. Finally, it smelts the raw iron using the chosen fuel and reports the total iron ingots obtained.
